#*: upp mitt hjarta og rómur með, <!--up my heart and ... -->
#*: hugur og tunga hjálpi til.
#*: herrans pínu '''ég''' minnast vil.
#*:: ''translation by [http://books.google.com/books?id=QT3CjgeSOIEC&dq=%22up%2C%20up%20my%20soul%22%20%22and%20tongue%22&pg=PR7#v=onepage&q=%22up,%20up%20my%20soul%22%20%22and%20tongue%22&f=false William Charles Green]'':
